# The skins pk3s, in load order. A pk3 never changes once it is out: players and servers keep the copy they
# have, so new themes go into a new tree and pk3. zzz_fatboss_skins_<v>.pk3 is first released in
# fatboss-skins-<v>; later releases attach that very file again (CI checks the tree still holds exactly it).
# pk3                       tree (under fatboss/)   themes (base: every theme but artskins.py's; art: artskins.py's)
zzz_fatboss_skins_s7.pk3    pk3-skins               base
zzz_fatboss_skins_s8.pk3    pk3-skins-s8            art
